drop tcp any any -> any any (msg:"EXFIL URI Database connection string with password"; pcre:"/\b(postgres(?:ql)?|mysql|mongodb(?:\+srv)?|redis)://[^:/\s]+:[^@/\s]{4,}@/i"; http_uri; classtype:"web-application-attack"; sid:1100231; rev:1;)
